---
// Usamos SVG directos para evitar cualquier problema de compilación con lucide-react y Vite en componentes .astro
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 py-16 border-t border-slate-800 mt-auto">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 lg:gap-8 mb-16">
      
      {/* Columna 1: Logo & Info */}
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <a href="#" class="inline-block">
          <span class="font-['Outfit'] text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
            Implantes Salud <span class="text-primary">Digital</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Clínica odontológica de vanguardia enfocada en resultados de por vida. Orgullosamente operando bajo estrictos estándares de calidad internacional.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-800/50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/50">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-500"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"/></svg>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200">ISO 9001 Certificado</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Columna 2: Horarios */}
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-['Outfit'] font-bold text-lg mb-6">Horarios de Atención</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-200">Lunes a Viernes</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">9:00 a 21:00 hs</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-200">Sábados</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">9:00 a 13:00 hs</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Columna 3: Contacto */}
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-['Outfit'] font-bold text-lg mb-6">Contacto</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-400">Lerma 294, Salta</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
            <a href="tel:+5493874218096" class="text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">+54 93874218096</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
            <a href="mailto:comercial@implantessalud.com" class="text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">comercial@implantessalud.com</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Columna 4: Redes Sociales */}
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-white font-['Outfit'] font-bold text-lg mb-6">Síguenos</h4>
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <a href="https://instagram.com/implantessalud" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors group">
            <div class="bg-slate-800 p-2 rounded-full group-hover:bg-primary transition-colors">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm">@implantessalud</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors group">
            <div class="bg-slate-800 p-2 rounded-full group-hover:bg-primary transition-colors">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm">Implantes Salud</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>

    {/* Fila Inferior: Copyright */}
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Implantes Salud Digital. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p class="text-center md:text-right">
        Clínica Odontológica Certificada. Los resultados pueden variar de un paciente a otro. <br class="hidden md:block"/> Todo procedimiento médico está sujeto a evaluación previa.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
